<title>UK: LME copper below $2,300 in PM ring, others weaker.</title>
<headline>LME copper below $2,300 in PM ring, others weaker.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Down sharply from day's highs, with cash/threes also contracting to $240/$250 versus $270 in AM ring. Loses ground in inter-office trade ahead of ring. Three months slides to $2,277. ALUMINIUM - Lower, support around $1,560. LEAD - Crumbles $19 to $639. OTHERS - Generally lower.</p>
</text>
